      "data": {
        "Name": "Viscosity",
        "ID": "Viscosity",
        "Description": "Viscosity measures a fluid's resistance to flow and affects how easily oil and gas (hydrocarbons, non-aqueous phase) move through a medium. In the context of reservoir simulation fluid modeling, this property of a phase could be included as a part of a table or calculated by a mathematical equation, such as mixing of component viscosities. ",
